@page "/about"
<PageTitle>About SecFlo</PageTitle>

<h1>About SecFlo</h1>

<p class="lead">
    SecFlo is a secure workflow system for managing cases, tracking progress, and supporting team-based review and approval.
</p>

<div class="row g-4 mt-3">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">What you can do</h5>
                <ul class="mb-0">
                    <li>Create and track cases from start to finish</li>
                    <li>Assign work to the right people</li>
                    <li>Update case status as work moves forward</li>
                    <li>Review case details and status history</li>
                    <li>See overall case statistics on the Stats page</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">How it helps</h5>
                <ul class="mb-0">
                    <li>Keeps work visible and organized</li>
                    <li>Supports secure sign-in and role-based access</li>
                    <li>Helps staff focus on assigned work</li>
                    <li>Gives managers quick insight into workload and progress</li>
                    <li>Reduces manual tracking and missed follow-ups</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mt-4">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Built for secure workflow management</h5>
        <p class="mb-0">
            SecFlo is designed to support authenticated users, role-based access, and a structured case workflow so teams can work efficiently while keeping data protected.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>